We make our middleware available as an extension method on the
IApplicationBuilder interface in a new source file:
public static class MiddlewareExtensions
{
public static IApplicationBuilder UseCustomLogger(this
IApplicationBuilder app)
{
return app.UseMiddleware<CustomLogger>();
}
}
The UseMiddleware method in IApplicationBuilder is used to register the middleware
class. The middleware will now be available in an instance of IApplicationBuilder in a
method called UseCustomLogger.
